title: "EPFL GIS Robotics Cell"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Eskandari
    given-names: Farzaneh
    affiliation: "EPFL (École Polytechnique Fédérale de Lausanne)"
    email: farzaneh.eskandari@epfl.ch
abstract: >-
  ROS2 packages for the EPFL GIS multi-robot cell: end-effector descriptions,
  force sensing, digital I/O control, and eye-in-hand perception for an ABB
  IRB6700 175/3.05 on an IRBT6004 7m linear rail with a Schunk SWS-160 tool
  changer. Includes the full flange-to-tool kinematic chain, hand-eye
  calibrated perception, and RWS-based I/O control for the tool changer and
  vacuum gripper.
keywords:
  - ROS2
  - robotics
  - ABB IRB6700
  - force control
  - hand-eye calibration
  - perception
  - digital fabrication
